      },
      "message": "docs(site): add a 4-axis and 5-axis machining guide section\n\nAdds site/content/guide/multi-axis/: an overview with the shipped\nmachines that have a rotary, plus pages for indexed 3+1/3+2 work,\ncontinuous 4-axis rotary operations, simultaneous 5-axis, machine\nkinematics and TCP, and the checks. Linked from the guide index.\n\nFixes #1279\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
